        "type": "reg",
        "input": "a = \"11\", b = \"1\"",
        "output": "\"100\"",
        "expectedOutput": "\"100\"",
        "explanation": "11 in binary is 3, plus 1 is 4, which is 100 in binary"
      },
      {
        "id": "sample_2",
        "type": "reg",
